# hardened - dynamic box preset (dynamic-box-arch, pure config-to-kernel)
#
# Self-contained multi-section blob for:  sbie-rt create hardened.kv
# The driver embeds NO defaults - the two skeleton sections below are
# the box's own copy (extracted from SandboxieOSS/Templates.ini);
# [BoxConfig] becomes the generated BoxConfig_<id> section.
#
# hardened (SMod-equivalent) box: de-admin + syscall lock-down +
# device restriction.  RestrictDevices=y turns on rule specificity, so
# the NormalFilePath whitelist below overrides ClosedFilePath=\Device\*.
# Device rules inline the old [TemplateSModPaths] content.

